         <pdf:Keywords>abstraction definitions, address space specification, bus definitions, design environment, EDA, electronic design automation, electronic system level, ESL, IEEE 1685‚Ñ¢, implementation constraints, IP-XACT, register transfer level, RTL, SCRs, semantic consistency rules, TGI, tight generator interface, tool and data interoperability, use models, XML design meta-data, XML schema</pdf:Keywords>
      </rdf:Description>
